# Legacy/alternative manual initial registration configuration.
# Under the transient auth key contract, TS_API_TOKEN is supplied only in the
# process environment, and short-lived single-use auth keys are provisioned on
# demand without persisting to disk. The router preserves state in the persistent
# Docker volume ('traefik_tailscale').
#
# Persisting TS_AUTHKEY to disk is obsolete and automatically scrubbed by the
# onboarding CLI. If bootstrapping manually without the CLI, a short-lived key
# may be injected in the process environment or placed here temporarily for initial start:
# TS_AUTHKEY="tskey-auth-REPLACE_WITH_A_TAILSCALE_AUTH_KEY"
